.TH TEXT_DRAW 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
text_draw \- Draw s at x,y (top\-left) in color with font f
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtext.h\(dq
.BI "void text_draw(Font f, float x, float y, Color color, const char *s);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Draw s at x,y (top\-left) in color with font f. Rendered strings are cached per font/color/string, so drawing the same label each frame is cheap; a label that changes every frame is not.
.SH MODULE
text (src/engine/text/text.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR text_size (3),
.BR draw_debug_text (3),
.BR gge (1),
.BR gge\-scenes (7)
